# Testing

Layers: unit → integration → API → database → AI/model → camera/service → E2E → performance → security.

Every major feature needs automated tests. Tests that cannot run because the app does not exist yet must be documented, not faked as passing.

Use Playwright for critical operator journeys (login, dashboard, cameras, incidents, alerts, RBAC). Patterns live in `tests/e2e/`. Do not install extra E2E stacks.

No production data in tests. Use isolated Neon branches or marked synthetic fixtures.

A change without tests is incomplete (`AGENTS.md` Principle 7).
